    "turn_text": "Jim, I'm watching last night and what I've been saying weeks ahead. People probably have asked you the same thing. What's your prediction? What's going to happen? What's going to happen? We didn't know what was going to happen. But what I said was, if we find out on election night, it's going to be Trump in a landslide. If we have to wait, then all sorts of issues can pop up. Did you feel the same way going into last night?",
